  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "An old Heavenly Court Gu Immortal smiles as his body turns into light specks and dissipates after saying he can only send the others here. His lifespan is exhausted. The arriving immortals tell Qin Song he can go peacefully, for it is their turn now.",
      "chapters": [
        1739
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Hidden Dragon Cave he has a solemn expression and says those who offend Central Continent will be killed. Among the Gu Immortals present he is the most senior, even Flesh Whip Immortal is his junior, and he orders them to reinforce Little Whip. Before leaving he tells Old Man Bei Feng he will leave the place to him, feels assured, and brings Heavenly Court Gu Immortals away as starlight pillars take the rank eights.",
      "chapters": [
        1924
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "senior-among-the-wake",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hidden_dragon_cave",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_flesh_whip_immortal",
        "char_old_man_bei_feng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His face turns pale and he coughs yellowish brown blood with countless small insects in the foam. Zhou Xiong Xin asks if Senior Qin is injured. Qin Song says it is an old injury, not from the fight. Narration states he is the key person for Heavenly Court’s powerful star cast killer move, that he is most skilled at teleportation, and that in the previous life he died prematurely escorting immortals toward Di Zang Sheng without a complete Immortal Gu set. This life he awakened earlier with comprehensive Immortal Gu and an advanced lifespan extension method, yet repeated battles cut his lifespan. Fairy Zi Wei calculates he can use at most four more movement killer moves before flesh and soul collapse. He smiles, coughs more yellow blood, and says four times is enough. Flesh Whip Immortal calls him Old Man Qin. The cause is an old injury from exploring Reckless Savage’s grave that still cannot be treated.",
      "chapters": [
        1926
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-cast-key-and-old-injury",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_xiong_xin",
        "char_di_zang_sheng",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ye Lui Kou scans the battlefield, finds Qin Song the weakest Heavenly Court Gu Immortal, and attacks because his weakened state is hard to conceal. Wan Zi Hong intercepts Ye Lui Kou.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "targeted-as-weakest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wan_zi_hong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan deduces Heavenly Court’s large scale star cast formation but does not deduce that Qin Song is the key figure. Narration notes that in his previous life Qin Song made a brief appearance and died after escorting Heavenly Court Gu Immortals to Hidden Dragon Cave.",
      "chapters": [
        1928
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hidden-from-fang-yuans-deduction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei notes that with Qin Song’s condition they can only use a large scale star cast method four more times, and that those uses will likely be expended before Eastern Sea Gu Immortals destroy all the arranged stars.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "four-uses-remaining",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    }
  ],
